1658
01:20:47,320 --> 01:20:49,620
It really happened, of all things

1659
01:20:49,620 --> 01:20:51,520
Of all things, yeah

1660
01:20:51,520 --> 01:20:55,660
Alright, we've gotta do something with this during the night session

1661
01:20:55,660 --> 01:20:58,360
We have to do something with this?

1662
01:20:58,360 --> 01:21:00,200
