1663
01:21:00,200 --> 01:21:03,460
Hey, can you fire the M249, Hime?

1664
01:21:03,460 --> 01:21:06,060
Should I shoot it?

1665
01:21:06,060 --> 01:21:07,700
Go ahead and shoot something, just to try it

1666
01:21:07,700 --> 01:21:08,660
Should I shoot something?

1667
01:21:08,660 --> 01:21:10,180
Just don't test it on Polka

1668
01:21:10,180 --> 01:21:12,600
I wonder what kind of damage this does

1669
01:21:12,600 --> 01:21:15,140
