1670
01:21:15,140 --> 01:21:18,920
Whoa, the sound is different!

1671
01:21:18,920 --> 01:21:22,360
Tomorrow I'll break down the wall with a jackhammer

1672
01:21:23,320 --> 01:21:24,980
